.TH Command COUNTRY-ROSTER
.SY "country"
The country roster command allows you to determine the number,
names and various other information about countries currently in the game.
.s3
The country roster contains
the country number ("#"),
the time that each country last logged out of the game ("last access"),
the number of Bureaucratic Time Units (B.T.U.s) remaining ("time"),
each nation's status ("status"),
and each country's full name ("country name").
.sp
For example:
.EX country
.NF
Wed Feb  2 18:06:51 1984
  #   last access       time    status	 country name
  0  Tue Feb  1 18:14   [255]   DEITY    POGO
  1   Now logged on     [227]   Active   Amerika
  2  Fri Jan 28 18:15   [73]    Active 	 Bongo - Bongo
  3  Tue Feb  1 18:40   [81]    Active   Caspar
  4  Mon Jan 31 21:04   [54]    Active   Doinkers
  5  Fri Jan 28 20:00   [106]   Active 	 East Eden
  6  Tue Feb  1 12:15   [0]     Active 	 Frodo
  7   Now logged on     [120]   Active   Groonland
.FI
.sp
